# HELP rivet_depot_cold_store_backpressure_total SlateDB writes held because a database's unflushed bytes reached its limit: each check that made a write wait (wait), and each wait that hit SlateDB's 30 s timeout with no flush finished (timeout). SlateDB logs these only at debug.
